'''Yamii''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Nature's Guardians ELEMENTAL PIXIES (Gacha Event)|Nature's Guardians ELEMENTAL PIXIES]] event. It was added in [[Version 10.10 Update|Version 10.10]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 12.1 Update|Version 12.1]] gains [[Wave Shield]] and doubles its health. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 15.2 Update|Version 15.2]].

