==Trivia==
*Yamii's name is derived from the Japanese word "闇" (''yami'') meaning "darkness."
*Yaminoir's name combines the aforementioned Japanese word with "noir," meaning "black" or "dark" in French.
*Yaminora's description implies that they evolved into a [[wikipedia:Black hole|black hole]]. This is supported by the Japanese description stating that light cannot escape their gravity and that they have a [[wikipedia:Gravitational singularity|singularity]] as described by [[wikipedia:General relativity|general relativity]].
*Yaminora's Catfruit Evolution description mentions that attack was increased. However, instead of increased damage, they actually gain increased health.
*Yaminora is one of the units to have its description rewritten in [[Version 14.5 Update|Version 14.5]], as "blocks Wave attacks" was changed to "has Wave Shield".

